# What wezterm.lua needs from outside Hammerspoon, declared beside the only file that
# knows this tool exists. Format is name | kind | locator | policy | reason.
#
# WezTerm carries no AppleScript dictionary either, so a fresh attach goes through its own
# CLI form instead, reached through open the same way Alacritty's provider is. Optional for
# the same reason, a missing backend only drops itself from the Settings list.
open | system | /usr/bin/open | optional | launching WezTerm with the start form that runs it attached to a session
